WEBVTT

00:00:56.790 --> 00:01:00.298
you might think, "Wow, I created that.

00:01:00.322 --> 00:01:01.998
This is who I am today."

00:01:02.736 --> 00:01:04.691
Then you would pick up your house keys,

00:01:04.715 --> 00:01:06.961
walk out the door into the real world,

00:01:06.985 --> 00:01:10.371
maybe take public transport
to the center of the town ...

00:01:11.709 --> 00:01:14.913
Possibly walk along the streets
or even go shopping.

00:01:15.731 --> 00:01:17.458
That's my life, every day.

00:01:18.686 --> 00:01:20.079
When I walk out the door,

00:01:20.103 --> 00:01:21.699
these artworks are me.

00:01:22.281 --> 00:01:24.377
I am art.

00:01:26.408 --> 00:01:29.572
I have lived as art my entire adult life.